Package: fastrel
Type: Package
Title: Fast Additive Relatedness Matrices from Pedigrees
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
  person("Alexandre", "Courtiol", email = "alexandre.courtiol@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0637-2959"))
  )
Description: Computes the additive relationship ("relatedness") matrix, twice
    the kinship matrix, of autosomal loci from a pedigree using the tabular
    method implemented in C++. Also provides a persistent store that updates the
    relatedness matrix incrementally as individuals are born, die, emigrate or
    immigrate, which avoids recomputing the whole matrix at each step of an
    individual-based simulation with a growing pedigree.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
